{
 "source": "whisper.cpp base.en over showcase-studio-take-2.mp4 (time zero = voiceover start); subword tokens merged",
 "segments": [
  {
   "text": "This video was made with Cloud Code right inside my app's own repo I didn't use a video editor I used Showcase Studio an open source app that turns your project folder into a video Cloud Code does the editing there's no video editor to learn and no new tool to pay for Open the builtin Cloud Terminal and start talking about the video you want to make Cloud will use the knowledge it has about your project to help you brainstorm and create a script The video is a YAML file in your repo Here's the YAML that makes this scene Change a line or swap a screenshot and the video rerenders The words define the timing a scene lasts as long as it takes to say its lines so shortening a sentence shortens a scene When it's time to record yourself open the script in a custom URL on your phone It scrolls the script like a teleprompter and you can record yourself on your phone camera Add the recording to your project assets and it's ready to include in the video One script gives you a TikTok style video a widescreen YouTube video and caption screenshots for the App Store Because it's all files your video is get managed Review Cloud's changes commit or revert On to try a different cut branch it and review the video the way you'd review code Videos of your app made with the cloud code you already have Download it from GetUp and run it in your project folder",
   "startMs": 160,
   "endMs": 92700,
